{"id":"vod_md_4590","vodId":"4590","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"邪神与厨二病少女","name_cn":"邪神与厨二病少女","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230910-1/850e506d10588098bf0f95852b599a9a.jpg"},"summary":"花园百合铃（大森日雅 配音）是一个标准的中二少女，虽然已经升入了大学，还整日里一副哥特萝莉的打扮，虽然右眼带着眼罩，但实际上视力毫无问题。表面看来，百合铃有些古怪和难以接近，可实际上，她对待朋友非常的热情友善。一次偶然中，百合铃竟然从魔界里召唤出了恶魔邪神酱（铃木爱奈 配音），她可是那里里地位最崇高的恶魔。邪神酱一心想要回到魔界，而回去的唯一方法就是杀死她的召唤者百合铃，可是实际上，邪神酱是一个笨手笨脚的废柴，每当她设计想要袭击百合铃时，总是会被后者在有意无意之中一招化解。除了邪神酱外，美杜莎（久保田未梦 配音）、佩柯拉（小坂井祐莉绘 配音）等恶魔也降临人间。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-10 07:46:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/wmRqbeVP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/n8IOlPm8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/SMniGdEg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/2mOj8geK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/LViOqwVo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/Y4uRat7F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/0rN3J3wJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/8OuL5zyE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/0r2MQnZb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/Z2qMSOp5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/00aKVfHz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/INrET52X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"SP","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/PJaKnTpf/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:48.587Z"}